**Definition 1.2 (unchanged source and observations).** Trees form the
free ordered binary magma

$$
\mathcal T::=\alpha\mid\beta\mid\langle\mathcal T,\mathcal T\rangle,
\qquad \operatorname{ht}(\alpha)=\operatorname{ht}(\beta)=0,
\quad \operatorname{ht}\langle u,v\rangle=1+\max(\operatorname{ht}u,\operatorname{ht}v).
$$

Every finite original-root word over $L,R$, including the empty word,
is a legal literal Read. Its reply $r_t(a)$ belongs to
$\mathcal A=\{\alpha,\beta,\mathsf{branch},\mathsf{absent}\}$;
traversal beyond a leaf gives absent. Retain exactly

$$
\begin{aligned}
\rho\alpha&=\beta,&\rho\beta&=\langle\beta,\alpha\rangle,&
\rho\langle u,v\rangle&=\langle\rho u,\rho v\rangle,\\
\mathcal F_D&=\{\langle\alpha,v\rangle:\operatorname{ht}(v)\le D\},&
W_D&=\{q:|q|\le D-1\},&\mathcal P_D&=\{Rq:q\in W_D\},
\end{aligned}
\tag{OOA.1}
$$

for public $D\ge1$. One actual initial source $t$ stays stationary
through preparation and acquisition; $\rho^kt$ is a prediction target.
There is no subtree, equality, source-identity, age, reset, copying,
navigation or advice port.

